{"id":"isiqli-qaragol","qid":"Q1438571","category":"lake","type":"hydronym","names":{"az":"İşıqlı Qaragöl","ru":"Севлич","en":"Lake Sev"},"coordinates":[46.23167,39.59806],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"serqi-zengezur","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q301832","az":"Laçın rayonu","en":"Lachin District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"İşıqlı Qaragöl, bəzən Qaragöl kimi qeyd olunur — Azərbaycanın Laçın rayonu ilə Ermənistanın Gorus rayonu sərhəddində yerləşir.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Севлич (арм. Սեւ լիճ), Ишиглы-Карагёль (азерб. İşıqlı Qaragöl) — «чёрное озеро»; устар. Карагелъ — озеро на границе Армении и Азербайджана. Расположено на территориях Сюникской области и Лачинского района соответственно. Высота над уровнем моря — 2650 метров. Площадь зеркала — 1,92 км², объём — 11 600 тыс. м³, диаметр озера — 1,5 км, длина береговой линии — 5 км, максимальная глубина — 7,8 м.\nТерритория вокруг озера покрыта растительностью, типичной для субальпийских лугов.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Lake Sev (Armenian: Սև լիճ, romanized: Sev lich; Azerbaijani: Qaragöl; both meaning \"black lake\") is a lake located on the border between Armenia and Azerbaijan. It is split between the Syunik Province of Armenia and the Lachin District of Azerbaijan, with the overwhelming majority of the lake being in Armenia.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Lake_Sev_02_%28cropped%29.jpg/960px-Lake_Sev_02_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Lake_Sev_02_%28cropped%29.jpg/960px-Lake_Sev_02_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":354,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lake_Sev_02_(cropped).jpg","title":"Lake Sev 02 (cropped).jpg","artist":"Albero","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q1438571: Lake Sev","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1438571","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"İşıqlı Qaragöl","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%C4%B0%C5%9F%C4%B1ql%C4%B1_Qarag%C3%B6l&oldid=9127078","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C4%B0%C5%9F%C4%B1ql%C4%B1_Qarag%C3%B6l","revid":9127078,"revDate":"2026-09-30","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Севлич","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%A1%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%87&oldid=146416603","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%87","revid":146416603,"revDate":"2025-07-16","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Lake Sev","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Lake_Sev&oldid=1366270260","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Sev","revid":1366270260,"revDate":"2026-07-27","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Lake Sev 02 (cropped).jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Common